# First quarter

Revenue for the quarter was $35200.00, and profit
$14700.00 after costs. The best month was
Mar, and the books closed on
2025-04-02.

Tax is charged at 20%, which comes to
$2940.00.

## Months over target

A sheet can be shown where it is asked for:

| Month |   Revenue |   Profit |
| :---- | --------: | -------: |
| Feb   | $12000.00 | $5000.00 |
| Mar   | $13200.00 | $5700.00 |

## Targets

A document can hold files of its own. This block is a file like any other,
and it reads the one named at the top:

| Month |     Goal |   Profit |     Over | Met   | Note                                     |
| :---- | -------: | -------: | -------: | :---- | :--------------------------------------- |
| Jan   | $4200.00 | $4000.00 | -$200.00 | false | a **slow** start                         |
| Feb   | $4500.00 | $5000.00 |  $500.00 | true  | see the [file format](../docs/format.md) |
| Mar   | $5000.00 | $5700.00 |  $700.00 | true  | the _best_ month, `Mar`                  |

2 of 3 months met
their goal.

